00:00:38.268 --> 00:00:43.640
MEANWHILE A BAR IN PORTLAND,

00:00:41.771 --> 00:00:56.353
HOSTED A REPARATION HOUR, WHERE

00:00:43.773 --> 00:00:56.353
NONWHITE PATRONS BANK FOR FREE.

00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:08.498
NONWHITE PATRONS BANK FOR FREE.

00:00:59.289 --> 00:01:09.432
&gt;&gt; THE GENTRIFIERS OF TODAY ARE

00:01:08.632 --> 00:01:11.801
SAYING, OH, THERE'S SO MANY

00:01:09.566 --> 00:01:13.203
OLIVE GARDENS I CAN GO TO, SO I

00:01:11.935 --> 00:01:15.105
NEED TO GO BACK TO THE CITY, GET

00:01:13.336 --> 00:01:18.174
MY LIFE IN THE CITY, BUT I NEED

00:01:15.238 --> 00:01:19.442
MY HOT YOGA STUDIO, MY POTTERY

00:01:18.308 --> 00:01:21.278
STUDIO, MY STUFF REPRESENTED.

00:01:19.576 --> 00:01:22.379
IF YOU INTRUDE ON THAT, I WILL

00:01:21.411 --> 00:01:22.379
THEN CALL THE POLICE.

00:01:27.484 --> 00:01:30.921
&gt;&gt; MORE AND MORE IT FEELS LIKE

00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:32.422
RACIAL DIVISION IS THE SUBTEXT

00:01:31.054 --> 00:01:36.159
OF VIRTUALLY EVERYTHING IN THIS

00:01:32.555 --> 00:01:37.627
COUNTRY, EVEN TOPICS THAT SEEM

00:01:36.293 --> 00:01:38.662
UNRELATED TO ETHNICITY SUDDENLY

00:01:37.761 --> 00:01:40.263
ARE RACIALLY FRAUGHT.

00:01:38.795 --> 00:01:41.965
THE EFFECT IS A DEEPLY ANGRY AND

00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:44.200
DIVIDED NATION, BUT ALSO YOU MAY

00:01:42.098 --> 00:01:45.869
HAVE NOTICED A TERRIFIED ONE.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:47.103
MANY AMERICANS ARE SCARED TO SAY

00:01:47.237 --> 00:01:50.206
JUST ABOUT ANYTHING.

00:01:48.271 --> 00:01:52.442
ONE FALSE WORD AND YOU COULD BE

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:53.076
DENOUNCED ON TWITTER AND LOSE

00:01:52.575 --> 00:01:53.777
YOUR LIVELIHOOD.

00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:57.480
IT HAPPENS.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:59.516
WE SEE IT ALL THE TIME.

00:01:57.614 --> 00:02:00.917
BEST IS TO SMILE AND NOD AND

00:01:59.649 --> 00:02:03.620
HOPE THE WITCH-HUNT PASSES.

00:02:01.051 --> 00:02:04.020
HOW LONG DO WE HAVE TO LIVE THIS

00:02:03.753 --> 00:02:05.221
WAY?

00:02:04.154 --> 00:02:05.522
HOW DID WE GET HERE IN THE FIRST

00:02:05.355 --> 00:02:08.625
PLACE?

00:02:05.655 --> 00:02:10.827
JOINING US A LAWYER WHO SERVES

00:02:08.758 --> 00:02:12.896
ON THE U.S. COMMISSION ON CIVIL

00:02:10.961 --> 00:02:14.464
RIGHTS, WRITTEN A NEW THRILLER,

00:02:13.029 --> 00:02:16.533
CALLED "SECOND STRIKE," WHICH I

00:02:14.597 --> 00:02:16.933
CAN TELL YOU FIRSTHAND IS

00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:17.867
EXCELLENT.

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:18.969
PETER, THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

00:02:19.102 --> 00:02:20.537
&gt;&gt; THERE'S SOMETHING STRANGE

00:02:20.036 --> 00:02:24.774
GOING ON.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:26.343
EVEN AS THE COUNTRY BECOMES MUCH

00:02:24.908 --> 00:02:27.944
MORE DIVERSE, SOMETHING WE WERE

00:02:26.476 --> 00:02:29.612
PROMISED WOULD MAKE THE COUNTRY

00:02:28.078 --> 00:02:30.613
MORE HARMONIOUS, THE COUNTRY

00:02:29.746 --> 00:02:31.481
SEEMS MORE ON EDGE ABOUT

00:02:30.747 --> 00:02:35.151
QUESTIONS OF RACE.

00:02:32.148 --> 00:02:37.020
WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:02:35.285 --> 00:02:39.022
&gt;&gt; SEVERAL THINGS ARE GOING ON,

00:02:37.754 --> 00:02:41.558
BUT THE OVERRIDING THING IS A

00:02:39.155 --> 00:02:43.560
POLITICAL NARRATIVE TO ENHANCE

00:02:42.092 --> 00:02:47.464
AN ARGUMENT OR ONE PARTICULAR

00:02:43.693 --> 00:02:47.964
SIDE, AND HAS ITS GENESIS IN TWO

00:02:47.597 --> 00:02:50.433
THINGS.

00:02:48.098 --> 00:02:51.668
FIRST IS THE POLITICAL

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:55.105
ELECTED CHIEFLY, AND SO WE HAVE

00:02:53.336 --> 00:02:58.174
A LOT OF THIS DIVISION ON THE

00:02:55.238 --> 00:02:58.975
BASIS OF RACE BECAUSE THERE ARE

00:02:58.308 --> 00:03:00.744
NO POLICY PRESCRIPTIONS ANYMORE.

00:02:59.109 --> 00:03:04.247
IF YOU LISTEN VERY CLOSELY, YOU

00:03:00.877 --> 00:03:05.582
DON'T HEAR ANY WORKABLE POLICY

00:03:04.381 --> 00:03:06.583
PRESCRIPTIONS, OR VERY FEW

00:03:05.715 --> 00:03:09.919
WORKABLE POLICY PRESCRIPTIONS,

00:03:06.716 --> 00:03:11.021
BUT WHAT YOU HEAR A LOT OF IT IS

00:03:10.053 --> 00:03:14.257
IDENTITY POLITICS.

00:03:11.154 --> 00:03:16.159
IN 17 YEARS, WE HAVEN'T HAD MORE

00:03:14.391 --> 00:03:17.594
LUCID CONVERSATIONS ABOUT RACE

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:20.063
OR IDENTITY.

00:03:17.727 --> 00:03:24.134
THEY'VE GOTTEN INCREASINGLY

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:26.002
SOPHOMORIC, OPAQUE, DRIVEN BY AN

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:26.870
AHISTORICAL NARRATIVE THAT HAS

00:03:26.136 --> 00:03:27.804
LITTLE BEARING THAT TRULY

00:03:27.003 --> 00:03:28.271
HAPPENED IN THE UNITED STATES OF

00:03:27.937 --> 00:03:30.907
AMERICA.

00:03:28.405 --> 00:03:32.942
LOOK, THE FACT OF THE MATTER IS

00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:35.311
THAT IN MY LIFETIME MATTERS OF

00:03:33.076 --> 00:03:37.313
RACE AND DISCRIMINATION HAS

00:03:35.445 --> 00:03:38.615
GOTTEN DEMONSTRABLY BETTER, IN

00:03:37.447 --> 00:03:38.982
WAYS THAT WE COULD NEVER HAVE

00:03:38.748 --> 00:03:40.750
IMAGINED.

00:03:39.115 --> 00:03:42.252
IF YOU LOOK AT THE INTERACTION

00:03:40.884 --> 00:03:44.554
BETWEEN INDIVIDUALS OF VARIOUS

00:03:42.385 --> 00:03:44.888
RACES TODAY THEY'VE NEVER BEEN

00:03:44.687 --> 00:03:45.722
BETTER.

00:03:45.021 --> 00:03:47.257
INDIVIDUALS OF RACES.

00:03:45.855 --> 00:03:49.092
WHEN YOU COME TO THE INTERACTION

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:51.027
BETWEEN GROUPS, IT'S BECOME

00:03:49.225 --> 00:03:53.096
HOSTILE AND TOXIC, AND IT'S A

00:03:51.161 --> 00:03:54.798
FUNCTION OF TRYING TO GET

00:03:53.229 --> 00:03:55.965
CERTAIN GROUPS TO HAVE AN

00:03:54.931 --> 00:03:57.467
ALLEGIANCE TO A CERTAIN MOVEMENT

00:03:56.099 --> 00:03:58.735
OR CERTAIN PARTY FOR POLITICAL

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.970
IMPERATIVE.

00:03:58.868 --> 00:04:02.372
&gt;&gt; MAY I STEP IN THERE AND BACK

00:04:01.104 --> 00:04:03.807
UP FOR A SECOND TO ADDRESS

00:04:02.505 --> 00:04:04.507
SOMETHING THAT YOU SAID THAT I

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.576
NEVER THOUGHT OF.

00:04:04.674 --> 00:04:08.044
THE CONVERSATION IS INCREASINGLY

00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:09.612
GENERAL AND LESS SPECIFIC.

00:04:08.178 --> 00:04:12.248
SO WHEREAS 30 YEARS AGO PEOPLE

00:04:09.746 --> 00:04:14.451
MIGHT SAY, IN ORDER TO CLOSE THE

00:04:12.382 --> 00:04:16.086
ACHIEVEMENT GAP IN STANDARD ICED

00:04:14.584 --> 00:04:17.187
TESTING, WE NEED TO PUT MORE

00:04:16.219 --> 00:04:17.520
MONEY INTO HEAD START, FOR

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.689
EXAMPLE.

00:04:17.654 --> 00:04:23.026
NOW THE CONVERSATION IS THIS

00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:25.261
GROUP IS BAD, IT HAS ALWAYS BEEN

00:04:23.159 --> 00:04:26.129
BAD, IT WILL NEVER GET BETTER.

00:04:25.395 --> 00:04:27.697
WHY ARE WE HEARING FEWER

00:04:26.262 --> 00:04:29.766
SOLUTIONS THAN WE USED TO HEAR?

00:04:27.831 --> 00:04:30.100
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK FOR A COUPLE OF

00:04:29.899 --> 00:04:32.435
REASONS.

00:04:30.233 --> 00:04:33.937
ONE AGAIN IS THAT POLITICAL

00:04:32.569 --> 00:04:35.371
IMPERATIVE, BECAUSE SOLUTIONS GO

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.738
AGAINST HAVING A POLITICAL

00:04:35.505 --> 00:04:37.474
ADVANTAGE.

00:04:35.872 --> 00:04:41.144
I THINK IT'S ALSO BECAUSE

00:04:37.607 --> 00:04:44.247
THERE'S A TENDENCY ON THE PART

00:04:41.277 --> 00:04:46.549
OF SOME TO SHUT DOWN OTHERS, TO

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:48.751
CAST OTHERS AS THE OTHER.

00:04:46.683 --> 00:04:49.152
AGAIN, THAT'S FOR POLITICAL

00:04:48.885 --> 00:04:49.519
IMPERATIVE.

00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:51.087
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:04:49.652 --> 00:04:52.789
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU'RE AFRAID TO SAY

00:04:51.221 --> 00:04:53.089
THINGS THAT ARE DEMONSTRABLY

00:04:52.922 --> 00:04:54.491
TRUE.

00:04:53.223 --> 00:04:56.192
TO GIVE YOU ONE EXAMPLE, A

00:04:54.624 --> 00:04:57.393
COUPLE OF WEEKS AGO WE HAD A

00:04:56.326 --> 00:05:02.866
HEARING AT THE U.S. COMMISSION

00:04:57.527 --> 00:05:03.700
ON CIVIL RIGHTS, ALL-DAY

00:05:02.999 --> 00:05:05.034
HEARING, EVERYBODY IN THE WORLD

00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:05.335
WAS THERE, THE USUAL GROUPS WERE

00:05:05.168 --> 00:05:08.104
THERE.

00:05:05.468 --> 00:05:09.372
IT WAS A HEARING ON HATE CRIMES

00:05:08.238 --> 00:05:10.607
BECAUSE OF THE SPIKE IN HATE

00:05:09.506 --> 00:05:10.974
CRIMES SINCE TRUMP HAS BEEN

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.509
ELECTED.

00:05:11.107 --> 00:05:13.910
BUT FACTS ARE STUBBORN THINGS.

00:05:12.642 --> 00:05:15.245
WHEN YOU TAKE A LOOK AT THE

00:05:14.043 --> 00:05:17.447
DATA, AND WHEN I ASKED QUESTIONS

00:05:15.378 --> 00:05:19.282
OF THIS, AFTER EVERYONE MADE

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.850
THESE GRAND PRONOUNCEMENTS ABOUT

00:05:19.415 --> 00:05:22.886
HOW HORRIBLE AND HORRIFIC THE

00:05:20.984 --> 00:05:24.888
SPIKE IN HATE CRIMES IS, WE HAD

00:05:23.019 --> 00:05:26.823
NO HARD EVIDENCE OF SUCH SPIKE.

00:05:25.021 --> 00:05:29.325
THE BEST DATA ON THIS COMES FROM

00:05:26.956 --> 00:05:29.726
THE BUREAU OF JUSTICE

00:05:29.459 --> 00:05:31.027
STATISTICS.

00:05:29.859 --> 00:05:33.596
WHAT IT'S SHOWN FOR THE LAST 30

00:05:31.161 --> 00:05:34.497
YEARS, THERE'S BEEN A DECLINE IN

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.065
HATE CRIMES.

00:05:34.631 --> 00:05:37.133
THERE'S BEEN A DECLINE IN ALL

00:05:36.199 --> 00:05:38.768
MANNER OF DISCRIMINATION FOR

00:05:37.267 --> 00:05:41.037
MORE THAN 30 YEARS.

00:05:38.902 --> 00:05:42.372
YET WE HAVE GREATER SENSITIVITY,

00:05:41.171 --> 00:05:43.740
HEIGHTENED SENSITIVITY, AND YOU

00:05:42.505 --> 00:05:45.308
HAVE TO ASK YOURSELF THIS, WHY

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:48.311
THIS IS THE CASE.

00:05:45.441 --> 00:05:51.214
I THINK TO SOME EXTENT IT'S

00:05:48.545 --> 00:05:52.549
BECAUSE IT HELPS THE AGENDA OF

00:05:51.347 --> 00:05:54.684
CERTAIN GROUPS OF CERTAIN

00:05:52.682 --> 00:05:56.452
PARTIES, CERTAIN INDIVIDUALS.

00:05:54.817 --> 00:05:57.687
&gt;&gt; SO YOU KEEP HEARING THAT WE

00:05:56.586 --> 00:05:58.922
NEED TO HAVE AN HONEST

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.323
CONVERSATION ON RACE.

00:05:59.055 --> 00:06:02.926
I'M ALWAYS FOR CONVERSATIONS,

00:06:00.456 --> 00:06:05.461
PARTICULARLY FOR HONEST ONES.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.629
I WONDER AFTER ALL THESE

00:06:05.595 --> 00:06:08.131
CONVERSATIONS IF THE COUNTRY IS

00:06:06.763 --> 00:06:09.132
