00:06:14.671 --> 00:06:17.840
&gt;&gt; TWO THINGS.

00:06:16.139 --> 00:06:18.274
TUCKER, I DISAGREE WE'RE HAVING

00:06:17.974 --> 00:06:20.843
CONVERSATIONS.

00:06:18.408 --> 00:06:23.079
WE ALWAYS HEAR WE NEED TO HAVE A

00:06:21.644 --> 00:06:25.148
