00:06:32.488 --> 00:06:35.858
YOU KNOW IF YOU GO TO COLLEGES,

00:06:34.157 --> 00:06:37.160
LAW SCHOOLS, ALMOST ANY

00:06:35.992 --> 00:06:42.332
