00:06:42.465 --> 00:06:45.034
CERTAIN ACCEPTABLE OPINIONS THEY

00:06:43.233 --> 00:06:46.269
CAN HAVE, AND STUDENTS ARE

00:06:45.168 --> 00:06:49.205
PUNISHED FOR THIS, AND THEY KNOW

00:06:46.402 --> 00:06:50.840
HOW TO REACT IN THE CONTEXT OF A

00:06:49.339 --> 00:06:51.441
CLASSROOM DEBATE OSTENSIBLY ON

00:06:51.274 --> 00:06:52.242
RACE.

00:06:51.574 --> 00:06:54.344
THERE'S ONLY ONE ACCEPTABLE

00:06:52.375 --> 00:06:55.411
OPINION, AND YOU'RE NOT ALLOWED

00:06:54.477 --> 00:06:56.913
TO OFFER OTHER OPINIONS.

00:06:55.545 --> 00:06:57.347
THAT DOESN'T FURTHER THE

00:06:57.046 --> 00:06:57.880
CONVERSATION.

